('bef850dd-ebda-5dd8-ba13-8d9a540007b9','856e76be-875b-54a9-97c6-c6e2e7358a00',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of equipment that makes a loud noise to warn you of danger','[ countable ]',null,'زنگ خطر، هشداردهنده؛ ساعت زنگ‌دار؛ ترس و دلهره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a burglar alarm Neighbours heard the burglar alarm and called the police.','an intruder/a security alarm The house has a system of security alarms.','a fire/smoke alarm A fire alarm went off and the building had to be evacuated.','a car alarm (= for when someone tries to steal a car ) I was woken by a car alarm in the middle of the night.','a baby alarm (= for when a baby wakes up and cries ) Is the baby alarm switched on?','a personal alarm (= that you carry with you in case you are attacked ) If you are nervous, invest in a personal alarm.','an alarm button He hit the alarm button under the desk.','an alarm system an electronic burglar alarm system','set off/trigger/activate the alarm (= make it start ringing ) A window blew open, setting off the alarm.','set the alarm (= make it ready to operate ) Did you set the burglar alarm?','an alarm goes off ( also an alarm sounds formal ) The thieves fled when an alarm went off.','switch/turn off the alarm I entered the shop and switched off the alarm.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I forgot to set the burglar alarm.","translation":"فراموش کردم دزدگیر دزدگیر را تنظیم کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603983.mp3"},{"sentence":"Car alarms are always going off in the street.","translation":"دزدگیر ماشین همیشه در خیابان خاموش می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000050.mp3"},{"sentence":"a sophisticated alarm system","translation":"یک سیستم هشدار پیشرفته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603993.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('eb7cf1a7-fda4-5fb8-87a3-55731b39d774','856e76be-875b-54a9-97c6-c6e2e7358a00',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a feeling of fear or worry because something bad or dangerous might happen','[ uncountable ]',null,'احساس ترس یا نگرانی زیرا ممکن است اتفاق بد یا خطرناکی رخ دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a burglar alarm Neighbours heard the burglar alarm and called the police.','an intruder/a security alarm The house has a system of security alarms.','a fire/smoke alarm A fire alarm went off and the building had to be evacuated.','a car alarm (= for when someone tries to steal a car ) I was woken by a car alarm in the middle of the night.','a baby alarm (= for when a baby wakes up and cries ) Is the baby alarm switched on?','a personal alarm (= that you carry with you in case you are attacked ) If you are nervous, invest in a personal alarm.','an alarm button He hit the alarm button under the desk.','an alarm system an electronic burglar alarm system','set off/trigger/activate the alarm (= make it start ringing ) A window blew open, setting off the alarm.','set the alarm (= make it ready to operate ) Did you set the burglar alarm?','an alarm goes off ( also an alarm sounds formal ) The thieves fled when an alarm went off.','switch/turn off the alarm I entered the shop and switched off the alarm.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is growing alarm at the increase in crime.","translation":"هشدار فزاینده ای در مورد افزایش جرم و جنایت وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603996.mp3"},{"sentence":"She looked up in alarm.","translation":"او با هشدار به بالا نگاه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001603999.mp3"},{"sentence":"Scientists have said there is no cause for alarm .","translation":"دانشمندان گفته اند هیچ دلیلی برای هشدار وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604000.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
