('ed62e1e1-a9f8-58da-8481-17a93418cb2f','258933c0-635b-5596-9aa5-2f69b63870b4',6,null,null,'literary','if something arises when you are moving towards it, you are gradually able to see it as you move closer',null,null,'اگر زمانی که به سمت آن حرکت می کنید چیزی به وجود می آید، با نزدیک شدن به آن به تدریج می توانید آن را ببینید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ccc6f100-8ee1-5f9a-8db9-3e07ec94e713','9135ad70-6298-5a82-802a-17e74c406efc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','carrying weapons , especially a gun',null,null,'مسلح، دارای سلاح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Armed police raided the building.","translation":"پلیس مسلح به ساختمان یورش برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000098.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Minister was kidnapped by armed men on his way to the airport.","translation":"وزیر در راه رفتن به فرودگاه توسط افراد مسلح ربوده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676533.mp3"},{"sentence":"The prisoners were kept under armed guard .","translation":"زندانیان تحت گارد مسلح نگهداری می شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000949030.mp3"},{"sentence":"The suspect is armed with a shotgun.","translation":"مظنون به یک تفنگ ساچمه ای مسلح است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000949033.mp3"},{"sentence":"She got ten years in prison for armed robbery (= stealing using a gun ) .","translation":"او به جرم سرقت مسلحانه (= دزدی با اسلحه) ده سال زندان گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676540.mp3"},{"sentence":"The president fears that armed conflict (= a war ) is possible.","translation":"رئیس جمهور می ترسد که درگیری مسلحانه (= جنگ) امکان پذیر باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676545.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is very little support for an armed struggle (= fighting with weapons ) against the government.","translation":"حمایت بسیار کمی از مبارزه مسلحانه (= جنگ با سلاح) علیه دولت وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676550.mp3"},{"sentence":"a heavily armed battleship","translation":"یک ناو جنگی با سلاح سنگین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000949037.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many of the gangs are armed to the teeth (= carrying a lot of weapons ) .","translation":"بسیاری از باندها تا دندان مسلح هستند (= حمل سلاح های فراوان).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676558.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('512fae91-48aa-54f3-ac34-962ec4d63977','9135ad70-6298-5a82-802a-17e74c406efc',2,null,null,'spoken & written','having the knowledge , skills , or equipment you need to do something',null,null,'داشتن دانش، مهارت یا تجهیزات لازم برای انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She came to the meeting armed with all the facts and figures to prove us wrong.","translation":"او با تمام آمار و ارقام به جلسه آمد تا ثابت کند اشتباه می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000949056.mp3"},{"sentence":"I went out, armed with my binoculars, to see what I could find in the fields.","translation":"من با دوربین دوچشمی ام بیرون رفتم تا ببینم در مزرعه چه چیزی پیدا می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676563.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8b38d0da-96cc-5188-9a1a-82264cc6580c','ccc0dd20-fc43-5dee-80a4-03d0c79e097e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','kept to be used later',null,null,'کنار، کنار گذاشته؛ جدا؛ جز (aside from)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve been setting aside a few pounds each week.","translation":"من هر هفته چند پوند کنار گذاشته ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991506.mp3"},{"sentence":"One of the rooms was set aside for a yoga class.","translation":"یکی از اتاق ها برای کلاس یوگا در نظر گرفته شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991510.mp3"},{"sentence":"Try to set aside a few hours a week for exercise.","translation":"سعی کنید چند ساعت در هفته را به ورزش اختصاص دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744650.mp3"},{"sentence":"Could you put this cake aside for me?","translation":"میشه این کیک رو برام کنار بذاری؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744654.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('acb415a0-5c3a-5127-ba91-2b030ef49140','ccc0dd20-fc43-5dee-80a4-03d0c79e097e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','moved to one side or away from you',null,null,'به یک طرف یا از شما دور شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He pushed his half-eaten salad aside and left.","translation":"سالاد نیمه خورده اش را کنار زد و رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744663.mp3"},{"sentence":"He stepped aside to let Katherine go in first.","translation":"او کنار رفت تا اول اجازه دهد کاترین وارد شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744669.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mark drew me aside and explained the problem.","translation":"مارک مرا کنار کشید و مشکل را توضیح داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744673.mp3"},{"sentence":"She swept her thick hair aside.","translation":"موهای پرپشتش را کنار زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744679.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('e4826670-62cf-564b-9b25-66c1252877e7','ccc0dd20-fc43-5dee-80a4-03d0c79e097e',3,null,null,'spoken & written','left to be considered or dealt with later, or not considered and dealt with at all',null,null,'باقی مانده است که بعداً مورد توجه یا رسیدگی قرار گیرد یا اصلاً مورد توجه و رسیدگی قرار نگیرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He brushed aside criticisms of his performance.","translation":"او انتقادات به عملکرد خود را کنار گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744687.mp3"},{"sentence":"Leaving aside the heat, we really enjoyed our holiday.","translation":"از گرما که بگذریم، واقعاً از تعطیلات خود لذت بردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744691.mp3"},{"sentence":"You must put aside your pride and call her.","translation":"باید غرورت را کنار بگذاری و به او زنگ بزنی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744694.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('138b17ca-d2c6-59a1-b081-158cca1c5d1c','ccc0dd20-fc43-5dee-80a4-03d0c79e097e',4,null,null,'spoken & written','used to show that something you have just said is not as important as what you are going to say next','[ only after noun ]',null,'برای نشان دادن اینکه چیزی که به تازگی گفته اید به اندازه آنچه که قرار است بعدا بگویید مهم نیست استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"These problems aside, we think the plan should go ahead.","translation":"از این مشکلات که بگذریم، فکر می کنیم این طرح باید پیش برود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991536.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('19fa5ae0-1c81-5325-ae29-952e0abbd7c2','ccc0dd20-fc43-5dee-80a4-03d0c79e097e',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'aside from somebody/something','کنار، کنار گذاشته؛ جدا؛ جز (aside from)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f41be1ce-2b6d-58d2-86b3-d702ebb92578','d0109388-6209-5196-802c-750a672fd324',1,null,null,'spoken & written','words spoken by an actor to the people watching a play, that the other characters in the play do not hear',null,null,'کلماتی که یک بازیگر به مردمی که نمایشنامه را تماشا می کنند گفته می شود که سایر شخصیت های نمایش نمی شنوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7d35cfa1-93cc-5738-ac25-654b23d806fc','d0109388-6209-5196-802c-750a672fd324',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a remark made in a low voice that you only intend particular people to hear',null,null,'سخنی با صدای آهسته گفته می شود که شما فقط قصد شنیدن آن را دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e649abb1-bfd8-5ae9-adae-9dc6ef1348ac','d0109388-6209-5196-802c-750a672fd324',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a remark or story that is not part of the main subject of a speech',null,null,'سخن یا داستانی که بخشی از موضوع اصلی یک سخنرانی نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I should add, as an aside, that the younger the child, the faster they learn.","translation":"من باید اضافه کنم که هر چه کودک کوچکتر باشد، سریعتر یاد می گیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744367.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9a44a27b-875b-58a1-ae72-ad0b558c5329','f69234f4-2fd5-587d-b06f-72c78a1ca397',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to prevent something bad from happening',null,null,'پرهیز کردن، اجتناب کردن؛ دور شدن از','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Road safety is taught to young children to avoid road accidents.","translation":"ایمنی جاده برای جلوگیری از تصادفات جاده ای به کودکان خردسال آموزش داده می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000928685.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is important to take measures to avoid the risk of fire.","translation":"مهم است که اقدامات لازم برای جلوگیری از خطر آتش سوزی انجام شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644458.mp3"},{"sentence":"The refugees left to avoid getting bombed.","translation":"پناهندگان برای جلوگیری از بمباران رفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644461.mp3"},{"sentence":"Alan narrowly avoided an accident.","translation":"آلن به سختی از تصادف جلوگیری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644462.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('98388d4d-d454-53dd-a970-682a157555f7','f69234f4-2fd5-587d-b06f-72c78a1ca397',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to stay away from someone or something, or not use something',null,null,'دوری از کسی یا چیزی یا استفاده نکردن از چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Everyone seemed to be avoiding Nick.","translation":"به نظر می رسید همه از نیک دوری می کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000928692.mp3"},{"sentence":"She carefully avoided his eyes (= did not look directly at his face ) .","translation":"او با دقت از چشمان او دوری کرد (= مستقیم به صورت او نگاه نکرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000928693.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pregnant women should avoid certain foods such as raw eggs.","translation":"زنان باردار باید از مصرف برخی مواد غذایی مانند تخم مرغ خام خودداری کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644469.mp3"},{"sentence":"Why did you speak to him? You usually avoid him like the plague (= try hard to avoid him ) .","translation":"چرا با او صحبت کردی؟ معمولاً مانند طاعون از او دوری می کنی (= برای دوری از او سخت کوشش کن).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644470.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3c1ae05c-fbba-5f0a-989f-8a0584ae29ee','f69234f4-2fd5-587d-b06f-72c78a1ca397',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to deliberately not do something, especially something wrong , dangerous , or harmful',null,null,'عمداً کاری را انجام ندادن، مخصوصاً کاری اشتباه، خطرناک یا مضر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are ways of legally avoiding taxes.","translation":"راه هایی برای فرار قانونی مالیات وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000928701.mp3"},{"sentence":"You should avoid over-spending in the first half of the year.","translation":"در نیمه اول سال باید از خرج کردن بیش از حد خودداری کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644479.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('81cf5716-a55a-5541-9384-c70406122db1','cb0506b8-19f2-5cb4-8e96-43a9a3d8b6fa',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not sleeping',null,null,'بیدار (نه خواب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['stay/keep/remain awake I was tired and it was hard to stay awake.','lie awake Kate lay awake thinking about what had happened.','keep somebody awake The noise of the airplanes kept me awake.','shake somebody awake Ben shook me awake and told me the news.','be wide/fully awake (= completely awake ) I''m never wide awake until I''ve had a cup of coffee.','be half awake (= not fully awake ) Most of the people on the train were only half awake.','be hardly/barely awake George, barely awake, came stumbling down the stairs.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I hope he’s awake now.","translation":"امیدوارم الان بیدار باشه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644485.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was still only half awake when I brought her a cup of coffee.","translation":"هنوز نیمه بیدار بود که برایش یک فنجان قهوه آوردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644486.mp3"},{"sentence":"How do you stay awake during boring lectures?","translation":"چگونه در طول سخنرانی های خسته کننده بیدار بمانید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644487.mp3"},{"sentence":"Emma lay awake half the night, worrying.","translation":"اما نیمی از شب بیدار بود و نگران بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644491.mp3"},{"sentence":"The noise brought him wide awake (= completely awake ) .","translation":"سر و صدا او را کاملاً بیدار (= کاملاً بیدار) آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644495.mp3"},{"sentence":"To keep themselves awake (= stop themselves from going to sleep ) they sat on the floor and told each other stories.","translation":"برای اینکه خود را بیدار نگه دارند (= خود را از خوابیدن بازدارند) روی زمین نشستند و به یکدیگر داستان گفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644500.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('42345d99-8ad2-5364-80db-66e5670737d3','cb0506b8-19f2-5cb4-8e96-43a9a3d8b6fa',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be awake to something','بیدار (نه خواب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['stay/keep/remain awake I was tired and it was hard to stay awake.','lie awake Kate lay awake thinking about what had happened.','keep somebody awake The noise of the airplanes kept me awake.','shake somebody awake Ben shook me awake and told me the news.','be wide/fully awake (= completely awake ) I''m never wide awake until I''ve had a cup of coffee.','be half awake (= not fully awake ) Most of the people on the train were only half awake.','be hardly/barely awake George, barely awake, came stumbling down the stairs.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c116910d-12bc-5051-b56e-887cbd6da13b','342f4c23-1849-5539-90d0-d50f06b05ad8',1,null,null,'formal','to wake up, or to make someone wake up',null,null,'بیدار شدن یا بیدار کردن کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was midday when she awoke.","translation":"ظهر بود که از خواب بیدار شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000929669.mp3"},{"sentence":"We awoke to a day of brilliant sunshine.","translation":"ما با یک روز آفتابی درخشان از خواب بیدار شدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644510.mp3"},{"sentence":"I woke up at 4 o''clock this morning.","translation":"امروز صبح ساعت 4 از خواب بیدار شدم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('5ce37b9d-a883-5193-a6dd-b1d6acb65074','342f4c23-1849-5539-90d0-d50f06b05ad8',2,null,null,'literary','if something awakes an emotion , or if an emotion awakes, you suddenly begin to feel that emotion',null,null,'اگر چیزی احساسی را بیدار کند، یا اگر احساسی بیدار شود، شما ناگهان شروع به احساس آن احساس می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The gesture awoke an unexpected flood of tenderness towards her.","translation":"این ژست سیل غیرمنتظره ای از حساسیت را نسبت به او بیدار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000929673.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0b442e0c-ffc4-582d-b71c-00b75779bcae','8f4f68f9-28e5-5414-bc36-797e1231cac7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something such as a prize or money given to someone to reward them for something they have done',null,null,'جایزه، اعطای رسمی (پول یا نشان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['win an award Caprio won the award for best actor. an award-winning novel','get/receive an award He is the youngest person ever to receive the award.','give somebody an award The award is given each year to the best new artist.','present somebody with an award (= give someone an award at a formal ceremony ) She cried when she was presented with her award.','be nominated for an award ( also be up for an award informal ) (= to be chosen as one of the people, films etc that could receive an award ) Four films have been nominated for the award. The book is up for an award.','pick up/scoop up an award (= to get an award – used especially in news reports ) Angelina Jolie scooped up the award for best actress.','the award goes to somebody/something (= that person, film etc is chosen to receive it ) The poetry award went to Lisa Mueller for ‘Alive Together''.','the highest award The Victoria Cross is Britain’s highest military award.','a top award/a major award The restaurant has won several top awards. Their design won a major award at a Paris exhibition.','a special award He received a special award for his work as a movie director.','a prestigious award (= very well-respected ) The Nobel Prize is regarded as the most prestigious award in the world.','a film/music/poetry etc award the annual British music awards','a literary award The book was nominated for a major US literary award.','an awards ceremony My parents wanted to be at the awards ceremony. The stars are gathering for the annual awards ceremony.','an award winner The award winners will be announced in December.','an award scheme British English The league started a new award scheme for young players.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The movie has won a number of awards.","translation":"این فیلم برنده جوایز متعددی شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000128.mp3"},{"sentence":"an award-winning restaurant","translation":"یک رستوران برنده جایزه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000129.mp3"},{"sentence":"the award for best student","translation":"جایزه بهترین دانش آموز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000130.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('55b0f64c-8e6c-5101-97c0-e5c7b5b1c705','8f4f68f9-28e5-5414-bc36-797e1231cac7',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something, especially money, that is officially given to someone as a payment or after a legal decision',null,null,'چیزی مخصوصاً پولی که رسماً به عنوان پرداخت یا پس از تصمیم قانونی به کسی داده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['win an award Caprio won the award for best actor. an award-winning novel','get/receive an award He is the youngest person ever to receive the award.','give somebody an award The award is given each year to the best new artist.','present somebody with an award (= give someone an award at a formal ceremony ) She cried when she was presented with her award.','be nominated for an award ( also be up for an award informal ) (= to be chosen as one of the people, films etc that could receive an award ) Four films have been nominated for the award. The book is up for an award.','pick up/scoop up an award (= to get an award – used especially in news reports ) Angelina Jolie scooped up the award for best actress.','the award goes to somebody/something (= that person, film etc is chosen to receive it ) The poetry award went to Lisa Mueller for ‘Alive Together''.','the highest award The Victoria Cross is Britain’s highest military award.','a top award/a major award The restaurant has won several top awards. Their design won a major award at a Paris exhibition.','a special award He received a special award for his work as a movie director.','a prestigious award (= very well-respected ) The Nobel Prize is regarded as the most prestigious award in the world.','a film/music/poetry etc award the annual British music awards','a literary award The book was nominated for a major US literary award.','an awards ceremony My parents wanted to be at the awards ceremony. The stars are gathering for the annual awards ceremony.','an award winner The award winners will be announced in December.','an award scheme British English The league started a new award scheme for young players.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the teachers’ pay award","translation":"جایزه حقوق معلمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000929751.mp3"},{"sentence":"an award for unfair dismissal","translation":"جایزه برای اخراج ناعادلانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644532.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('feda4171-b7ad-59e0-9f51-e8d25b69d908','4c6f4477-d396-590b-b20e-2f71c352fe33',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially give someone something such as a prize or money to reward them for something they have done',null,null,'اعطا کردن، اهدا کردن (رسمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Moodie has been awarded a golf scholarship at the University of Hawaii.","translation":"به مودی بورسیه تحصیلی گلف در دانشگاه هاوایی اعطا شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644533.mp3"},{"sentence":"The judge awarded me first prize.","translation":"داور جایزه اول را به من داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644536.mp3"},{"sentence":"A Nobel Prize was awarded to Waksman in 1952.","translation":"جایزه نوبل در سال 1952 به واکسمن اعطا شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644539.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('c5b58ec8-7909-55ee-8a59-32e5dccec8c1','4c6f4477-d396-590b-b20e-2f71c352fe33',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially decide that someone should receive a payment or a formal agreement',null,null,'به طور رسمی تصمیم بگیرید که شخصی باید یک پرداخت یا یک توافق رسمی دریافت کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The government awarded a German company the contract.","translation":"دولت این قرارداد را به یک شرکت آلمانی اعطا کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644542.mp3"},{"sentence":"£45,000 was awarded to a typist with an injured hand.","translation":"45000 پوند به یک تایپیست با دست آسیب دیده اهدا شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644545.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8646930b-c946-5084-880b-ca04f20b8e3c','14218d7c-9285-5b29-a4c6-10f5144b185b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if you are aware that a situation exists , you realize or know that it exists',null,null,'آگاه، واقف؛ مطلع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The children are aware of the danger of taking drugs.","translation":"کودکان از خطر مصرف مواد آگاه هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644548.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mr Braley has been made aware of the need for absolute secrecy.","translation":"آقای برالی از نیاز به رازداری مطلق آگاه شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644552.mp3"},{"sentence":"Were you aware that Joe had this problem with his knee?","translation":"آیا می دانستید که جو این مشکل را با زانوی خود داشت؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644551.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were well aware that the company was losing money.","translation":"آنها به خوبی می دانستند که شرکت در حال ضرر دادن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997912.mp3"},{"sentence":"As you are aware, a fee will be charged annually.","translation":"همانطور که مستحضر هستید سالانه هزینه ای دریافت می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644556.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('00b01506-aa23-53e9-8ff2-ec132c826772','14218d7c-9285-5b29-a4c6-10f5144b185b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if you are aware of something, you notice it, especially because you can see, hear, feel, or smell it',null,null,'اگر از چیزی آگاه باشید، متوجه آن می شوید، مخصوصاً به این دلیل که می توانید آن را ببینید، بشنوید، احساس کنید یا بو کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was aware of a tall dark figure watching her.","translation":"او متوجه شد که یک چهره ی تاریک بلند او را تماشا می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644559.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was aware of the wind in his face.","translation":"از باد در صورتش آگاه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644560.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bill became aware that he was still holding his glass.","translation":"بیل متوجه شد که هنوز لیوانش را نگه داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644563.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('34b662af-2d63-576b-a540-1827d201049b','14218d7c-9285-5b29-a4c6-10f5144b185b',3,null,null,'spoken & written','understanding a lot about what is happening around you and paying attention to it, especially because you realize possible dangers and problems',null,null,'درک چیزهای زیادی در مورد آنچه در اطراف شما اتفاق می افتد و توجه به آن، به ویژه به دلیل اینکه متوجه خطرات و مشکلات احتمالی می شوید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the socially aware novels of Dickens","translation":"رمان های آگاه اجتماعی دیکنز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997940.mp3"},{"sentence":"We should promote environmentally aware and responsible science.","translation":"ما باید علم محیط زیست آگاه و مسئولانه را ترویج کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644567.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('78e6ffe2-e374-5c78-a87e-c061a4f26afc','14218d7c-9285-5b29-a4c6-10f5144b185b',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'so/as far as I am aware','آگاه، واقف؛ مطلع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('97995988-3592-5c7b-9f0d-19a558d409e7','6880bee4-3d66-52b7-b1d1-12905dec83b3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','very bad or unpleasant',null,null,'خیلی بد، فجیع؛ عجیب و سخت (باید بگویم)',array['terrible']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The weather was awful.","translation":"هوا افتضاح بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998098.mp3"},{"sentence":"He is a pretty awful driver.","translation":"او یک راننده بسیار افتضاح است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998099.mp3"},{"sentence":"That fridge smells awful.","translation":"اون یخچال بوی بدی میده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998100.mp3"},{"sentence":"The last six months have been awful for her.","translation":"شش ماه گذشته برای او وحشتناک بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998101.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve stopped believing most of what he says. Isn’t that awful?","translation":"من از باور بیشتر چیزهایی که او می گوید، دست برداشته ام. این افتضاح نیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644582.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m sure Suzy is dead but the awful thing is not knowing how it happened.","translation":"من مطمئن هستم که سوزی مرده است، اما چیز وحشتناک این است که نمی دانم چگونه اتفاق افتاده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644583.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('2ce27a64-e35a-50e6-91cb-8af85a8111c6','6880bee4-3d66-52b7-b1d1-12905dec83b3',2,null,null,'spoken','used to emphasize how much or how good, bad etc something is','[ only before noun ]',null,'برای تأکید بر اینکه چیزی چقدر یا چقدر خوب، بد و غیره است استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"An awful lot of people (= a large number of people ) died in the war.","translation":"تعداد زیادی از مردم (= تعداد زیادی از مردم) در جنگ کشته شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644587.mp3"},{"sentence":"He made me feel an awful fool.","translation":"او به من احساس یک احمق وحشتناک را داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644592.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
