('2d67091b-c16c-5a75-b62b-cb8be42764cf','00f87e39-2ff4-5e7d-82c8-a8fa887e2fdb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in an unsatisfactory or unsuccessful way',null,null,'بد، ضعیف؛ شدیداً، سخت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company has been very badly managed.","translation":"این شرکت بسیار بد مدیریت شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000931237.mp3"},{"sentence":"The novel was translated badly into English.","translation":"رمان بد به انگلیسی ترجمه شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001731571.mp3"},{"sentence":"badly made furniture","translation":"مبلمان بد ساخته شده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000931239.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rob did very badly in the History exam.","translation":"راب در امتحان تاریخ بسیار بد عمل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000931243.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('ee22e840-e9f5-5878-aa2d-148fe80f611d','00f87e39-2ff4-5e7d-82c8-a8fa887e2fdb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to a great or serious degree',null,null,'به درجه ای بزرگ یا جدی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['badly damaged Both cars were badly damaged in the accident.','badly hurt/injured/wounded Fortunately no one was badly hurt.','badly affected Albania was badly affected by industrial unrest.','badly hit (= be badly affected ) Businesses have been badly hit by the economic slowdown.','badly shaken (= be very upset or frightened ) Both boys were badly shaken by the incident.','want something badly Caroline wanted the job badly.','miss somebody badly (= feel very sad because you are not with someone you love ) Lucy was missing Gary badly.','suffer badly The town suffered badly during the last war.','be badly in need of something (= need something very much ) He felt badly in need of a cup of coffee.','go badly wrong (= go wrong in a serious way ) Their election campaign had gone badly wrong.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s been limping badly ever since the skiing accident.","translation":"او از زمان حادثه اسکی به شدت لنگیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000931247.mp3"},{"sentence":"We badly wanted to help, but there was nothing we could do.","translation":"ما به شدت می خواستیم کمک کنیم، اما کاری از دستمان بر نمی آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001731577.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was beaten so badly that his brother didn’t recognize him.","translation":"او را چنان کتک زدند که برادرش او را نشناخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001731578.mp3"},{"sentence":"The school is badly in need of (= very much needs ) some new computers.","translation":"مدرسه به شدت به تعدادی کامپیوتر جدید (= بسیار نیاز دارد) نیاز دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001731579.mp3"},{"sentence":"Things started to go badly wrong (= go wrong in a serious way ) for Eric after he lost his job.","translation":"بعد از اینکه اریک کارش را از دست داد، همه چیز به طرز بدی پیش رفت (= به شکلی جدی اشتباه شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000931256.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('84205747-afd6-5ccb-ba98-174e8ebf634c','00f87e39-2ff4-5e7d-82c8-a8fa887e2fdb',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'think badly of somebody/something','بد، ضعیف؛ شدیداً، سخت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('14cf66ec-1dbc-5370-8c63-587bff57d58c','3f1be36a-140d-544d-aaea-4b56f573d959',1,null,null,'spoken & written','forming the most important or most necessary part of something',null,null,'پایه‌ای، اساسی، بنیادی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the basic idea The basic idea is that science discovers the truth of how the world works.','a basic principle The basic principles underlying all the systems are the same.','basic information This leaflet has been designed to provide some basic information.','basic facts You should start by giving the basic facts.','basic rules Most people nowadays are aware of some of the basic rules of healthy living.','a basic question The interviewer will ask you some basic questions about your education and work experience.','a basic concept He was unfamiliar with the most basic concepts of chemistry.','basic services They lack basic services such as water and electricity.','basic research We need basic research into the causes of mental illness.','a basic ingredient of something The ability to adapt is a basic ingredient of survival.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the basic principles of chemistry","translation":"اصول اولیه شیمی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936355.mp3"},{"sentence":"The basic idea is simple.","translation":"ایده اصلی ساده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936356.mp3"},{"sentence":"basic research","translation":"تحقیق پایه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658554.mp3"},{"sentence":"basic information","translation":"اطلاعات اولیه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658556.mp3"},{"sentence":"medical techniques basic to the control of infection","translation":"تکنیک های پزشکی اساسی برای کنترل عفونت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658560.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('a096d9ea-db5a-5278-9afe-f4e21091f72b','3f1be36a-140d-544d-aaea-4b56f573d959',2,null,null,'spoken & written','at the simplest or least developed level',null,null,'در ساده ترین یا کمتر توسعه یافته ترین سطح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the basic idea The basic idea is that science discovers the truth of how the world works.','a basic principle The basic principles underlying all the systems are the same.','basic information This leaflet has been designed to provide some basic information.','basic facts You should start by giving the basic facts.','basic rules Most people nowadays are aware of some of the basic rules of healthy living.','a basic question The interviewer will ask you some basic questions about your education and work experience.','a basic concept He was unfamiliar with the most basic concepts of chemistry.','basic services They lack basic services such as water and electricity.','basic research We need basic research into the causes of mental illness.','a basic ingredient of something The ability to adapt is a basic ingredient of survival.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the basic skills of programming","translation":"مهارت های اساسی برنامه نویسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658561.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their knowledge is very basic.","translation":"دانش آنها بسیار ابتدایی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936361.mp3"},{"sentence":"The farm lacks even basic equipment .","translation":"مزرعه فاقد تجهیزات اولیه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658565.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('20511f3d-63a1-5be4-8434-94bcab8897c8','3f1be36a-140d-544d-aaea-4b56f573d959',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'basic salary/pay/pension etc','پایه‌ای، اساسی، بنیادی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the basic idea The basic idea is that science discovers the truth of how the world works.','a basic principle The basic principles underlying all the systems are the same.','basic information This leaflet has been designed to provide some basic information.','basic facts You should start by giving the basic facts.','basic rules Most people nowadays are aware of some of the basic rules of healthy living.','a basic question The interviewer will ask you some basic questions about your education and work experience.','a basic concept He was unfamiliar with the most basic concepts of chemistry.','basic services They lack basic services such as water and electricity.','basic research We need basic research into the causes of mental illness.','a basic ingredient of something The ability to adapt is a basic ingredient of survival.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b40ca0fa-76c7-5a54-a1da-43fade915a77','3f1be36a-140d-544d-aaea-4b56f573d959',4,null,null,'spoken & written','basic rights, needs etc are ones that everyone needs or should have','[ only before noun ]',null,'حقوق اساسی، نیازها و غیره آنهایی هستند که همه به آن نیاز دارند یا باید داشته باشند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the basic idea The basic idea is that science discovers the truth of how the world works.','a basic principle The basic principles underlying all the systems are the same.','basic information This leaflet has been designed to provide some basic information.','basic facts You should start by giving the basic facts.','basic rules Most people nowadays are aware of some of the basic rules of healthy living.','a basic question The interviewer will ask you some basic questions about your education and work experience.','a basic concept He was unfamiliar with the most basic concepts of chemistry.','basic services They lack basic services such as water and electricity.','basic research We need basic research into the causes of mental illness.','a basic ingredient of something The ability to adapt is a basic ingredient of survival.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"basic human rights","translation":"حقوق اولیه بشر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936370.mp3"},{"sentence":"poor families unable to meet their basic needs","translation":"خانواده های فقیر قادر به تامین نیازهای اولیه خود نیستند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000149.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('94bff54c-4ee5-5376-a96b-5b083a1fcb6b','a07ba4ee-1dd8-54d6-a9f7-523de8e9c754',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the facts, ideas, or things from which something can be developed','[ countable ]',null,'مبنا، اساس؛ پایه استدلال','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['form the basis of something This research will form the basis of a book.','provide a basis for something The poem provided the basis for an interesting class discussion.','become the basis of/for something Some of these ideas became the basis for the Parents’ Educational Union.','serve as a basis for something The document will serve as a basis for negotiations.','establish a basis ( also lay a basis ) (= create something from which something can be developed ) The agreement established a sound basis for international commerce.','have a basis Our constitution has a democratic basis.','have no basis in fact (= be not true ) Many of these rumours have no basis in fact.','a good basis Love and trust form a good basis for marriage.','a sound/firm/solid basis Drama school may provide a sound basis for an acting career.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Their claim had no basis in fact (= it was not true ) .","translation":"ادعای آنها هیچ مبنایی نداشت (= درست نبود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936453.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bread forms the basis of their daily diet.","translation":"نان اساس رژیم غذایی روزانه آنها را تشکیل می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936459.mp3"},{"sentence":"The video will provide a basis for class discussion.","translation":"این ویدئو مبنایی برای بحث در کلاس فراهم می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936456.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4ceeb8bc-747d-5914-9963-ea7a5e1ad968','a07ba4ee-1dd8-54d6-a9f7-523de8e9c754',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'on the basis of something','مبنا، اساس؛ پایه استدلال','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['form the basis of something This research will form the basis of a book.','provide a basis for something The poem provided the basis for an interesting class discussion.','become the basis of/for something Some of these ideas became the basis for the Parents’ Educational Union.','serve as a basis for something The document will serve as a basis for negotiations.','establish a basis ( also lay a basis ) (= create something from which something can be developed ) The agreement established a sound basis for international commerce.','have a basis Our constitution has a democratic basis.','have no basis in fact (= be not true ) Many of these rumours have no basis in fact.','a good basis Love and trust form a good basis for marriage.','a sound/firm/solid basis Drama school may provide a sound basis for an acting career.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8c89d4fb-929f-5b83-8ad3-1fa4a872b924','a07ba4ee-1dd8-54d6-a9f7-523de8e9c754',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the way that something happens, or the way that something is organized or done','[ singular ]',null,'روشی که چیزی اتفاق می افتد، یا روشی که چیزی سازماندهی یا انجام می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['form the basis of something This research will form the basis of a book.','provide a basis for something The poem provided the basis for an interesting class discussion.','become the basis of/for something Some of these ideas became the basis for the Parents’ Educational Union.','serve as a basis for something The document will serve as a basis for negotiations.','establish a basis ( also lay a basis ) (= create something from which something can be developed ) The agreement established a sound basis for international commerce.','have a basis Our constitution has a democratic basis.','have no basis in fact (= be not true ) Many of these rumours have no basis in fact.','a good basis Love and trust form a good basis for marriage.','a sound/firm/solid basis Drama school may provide a sound basis for an acting career.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m saving money on a regular basis.","translation":"من به طور منظم پول پس انداز می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000936469.mp3"},{"sentence":"Board meetings are held on a weekly basis.","translation":"جلسات هیئت مدیره به صورت هفتگی برگزار می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00085.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nurses are employed on a full-time basis.","translation":"پرستاران به صورت تمام وقت مشغول به کار هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658589.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('28c86a01-fa56-5eab-ac61-afc98d7e3572','f4439a74-c8be-528c-be4a-aab7ee6565a7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an area of sand or small stones at the edge of the sea or a lake',null,null,'ساحل (دریا یا دریاچه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['crowded In the summer the beaches get very crowded.','quiet (= with few people on it ) The beaches on this side of the island are quieter.','deserted/empty (= with no one on it ) We took a boat to a deserted beach.','a sandy beach Corfu is known for its sandy beaches.','a shingle/pebble/pebbly beach (= covered with very small stones ) Both resorts have small shingle beaches.','a rocky beach (= with large rocks on it ) They anchored the boat off a rocky beach.','a long beach All around the coast of Lanzarote are long beaches of golden sand.','a white/golden beach The house was beside a dazzling white beach.','a private beach (= owned by someone, so you need permission to use it ) The hotel has its own private beach.','a public beach (= for everyone to use ) The public beaches were very dirty.','lie on the beach I find it boring just lying on the beach all day.','go to the beach They''ve gone to the beach for the weekend.','walk on/along the beach She loved to walk along the beach in the early morning.','a beach holiday British English (= a holiday spent mainly at the beach ) She loves beach holidays, while he prefers city breaks.','a beach resort This is one of the most popular beach resorts in Greece.','a beach hut (= a small building on the beach for storing things such as swimming or sports equipment ) a row of brightly painted beach huts','a beach bar/restaurant (= on the beach ) We watched the sun go down from the beach bar.','a beach towel They spread out beach towels and opened parasols.','beach volleyball/football (= played on the beach ) Who wants a game of beach volleyball?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is a beautiful sandy beach.","translation":"یک ساحل شنی زیبا وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00090.mp3"},{"sentence":"It''s a nice day for going to the beach.","translation":"روز خوبی برای رفتن به ساحل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00091.mp3"},{"sentence":"We walked along the beach.","translation":"کنار ساحل قدم زدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00092.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our hotel was right next to the beach.","translation":"هتل ما دقیقا کنار ساحل بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00093.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
