('23308765-c910-5990-9f1f-f4a183170658','9d8e797a-e25f-5ddb-a3b7-001ac1a7cf98',1,null,null,'spoken & written','responsibility for a mistake or for something bad',null,null,'مسئولیت یک اشتباه یا چیز بد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['get the blame (= be blamed ) Sam knew that if something went wrong, he’d get the blame.','take/accept/shoulder the blame (= say that something is your fault ) No one was prepared to take the blame for the disaster. Parents must shoulder the blame if their kids behave badly.','put/pin the blame on somebody ( also lay/place the blame on somebody written ) (= blame someone, especially when it is not their fault ) Don’t try to put the blame on me. Everyone laid the blame for the crisis on the government.','shift the blame (onto somebody) (= blame someone else for something you did ) She always tried to shift the blame onto her brother.','apportion/assign blame formal (= find someone to blame for something ) He seemed to want to apportion blame for her death.','share the blame He admitted he shared the blame for their World Cup defeat.','the blame lies with somebody (= used to say that someone is responsible for something bad ) In this case, the blame lay with the police.','place the blame squarely/firmly on somebody (= blame someone in a very definite way ) A military investigation placed the blame squarely on city officials.','point the finger of blame at somebody (= say that someone is responsible for something bad ) I couldn’t believe it when they started pointing the finger of blame at me.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you accept any blame for what happened?","translation":"آیا شما هیچ سرزنشی را برای آنچه اتفاق افتاده می پذیرید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001892131.mp3"},{"sentence":"I always get the blame (= am blamed ) for his mistakes!","translation":"من همیشه به خاطر اشتباهات او سرزنش می شوم (= سرزنش می شوم)!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001892137.mp3"},{"sentence":"She stole the money but she’s trying to put the blame on (= blame ) me.","translation":"او پول را دزدید، اما سعی می‌کند تقصیر را به گردن (= سرزنش) من بیندازد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001892147.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b1ac0946-b409-564c-b53e-58f7651191e6','7c54a306-5aae-5c10-9b8c-6cd94494f188',1,null,null,'spoken & written','without any writing, print , or recorded sound',null,null,'خالی (بدون نوشته یا ضبط)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Leave the last page blank .","translation":"صفحه آخر را خالی بگذارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000918954.mp3"},{"sentence":"a blank cassette","translation":"یک کاست خالی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000918955.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
