('171c7ab1-9267-5398-9b4c-7337d587939c','2dce8f3d-55e0-5d8c-8e1f-48c843a6a3ac',1,'wide','گسترده','spoken & written','a road, river , or part of someone’s body etc that is broad is wide',null,null,'پهن، عریض؛ گسترده (نظر، ذهن)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We went along a broad passage.","translation":"از گذرگاه وسیعی گذشتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001040338.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was six feet tall, with broad shoulders.","translation":"او شش فوت قد داشت و شانه های پهن داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001040339.mp3"},{"sentence":"The room is three metres long and two metres broad.","translation":"این اتاق سه متر طول و دو متر عرض دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001679022.mp3"},{"sentence":"a wide river/street/corridor","translation":"یک رودخانه / خیابان / راهرو وسیع","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"They sell a wide range of bikes.","translation":"آنها طیف گسترده ای از دوچرخه ها را می فروشند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('db0c7804-cb50-5b2b-a9fe-d55f2e2ff47e','2dce8f3d-55e0-5d8c-8e1f-48c843a6a3ac',2,'including a lot','از جمله بسیاری','spoken & written','including many different kinds of things or people',null,null,'از جمله بسیاری از انواع مختلف چیزها یا افراد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a broad range Sport is a part of a broad range of activities that we call leisure.','a broad spectrum (= range ) Among the public there is a broad spectrum of opinion.','a broad category Our range of programmes fall into three broad categories.','a broad area/field (= including a lot of different things ) Psychobiology is a broad area covering many different topics.','a broad cross-section (= a varied group that is typical of a larger varied group ) We offer entertainment to appeal to a broad cross-section of people.','a broad base The course is designed to provide a broad base for students looking to work in IT.','a broad alliance/coalition The government was a broad alliance of eight political parties.','a broad curriculum (= one that includes a range of subjects ) Students are encouraged to follow a broad curriculum in the first year.','have broad appeal (= be attractive to many different types of people ) Their music has a very broad appeal.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The show aims to reach the broadest possible audience.","translation":"این نمایش با هدف دستیابی به گسترده ترین مخاطبان ممکن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001679024.mp3"},{"sentence":"Students here study a broad range of subjects.","translation":"دانش آموزان در اینجا طیف گسترده ای از موضوعات را مطالعه می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001040354.mp3"},{"sentence":"Private pension schemes fall into two broad categories.","translation":"طرح های بازنشستگی خصوصی به دو دسته کلی تقسیم می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001040357.mp3"},{"sentence":"a party which lacks a broad base of political support","translation":"حزبی که فاقد پایگاه گسترده ای از حمایت سیاسی است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001679025.mp3"},{"sentence":"The play is a comedy, in the broadest sense of the word .","translation":"نمایشنامه به معنای وسیع کلمه یک کمدی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001679029.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
