('f3c8ff12-c4c8-58a8-8c6e-3a5cce03cb63','7db3024d-088d-5234-9789-35bf0144515c',1,'joined rings','حلقه های متصل','spoken & written','a series of metal rings which are joined together in a line and used for fastening things, supporting weights , decoration etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',', jewellery','زنجیر؛ زنجیره (فروشگاه‌ها)؛ سلسله','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She had a gold chain around her neck.","translation":"زنجیر طلایی به گردن داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068800.mp3"},{"sentence":"a length of heavy chain","translation":"طول زنجیره سنگین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068801.mp3"},{"sentence":"the mayor’s chain of office (= a decoration worn by some British officials at ceremonies )","translation":"زنجیره دفتر شهردار (= تزئیناتی که برخی از مقامات انگلیسی در مراسم می پوشند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687324.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fc7e0ed9-cdf1-5ff4-af66-06f05497acf6','7db3024d-088d-5234-9789-35bf0144515c',2,'connected events','رویدادهای مرتبط','spoken & written','a connected series of events or actions, especially which lead to a final result','[ countable ]','chain of command , food chain','مجموعه ای از رویدادها یا اقدامات مرتبط، به ویژه که منجر به نتیجه نهایی می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the chain of events that led to World War I","translation":"زنجیره حوادثی که منجر به جنگ جهانی اول شد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068820.mp3"},{"sentence":"The salesmen are just one link in the chain (= part of a process ) of distribution.","translation":"فروشندگان تنها یک حلقه در زنجیره (= بخشی از یک فرآیند) توزیع هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687337.mp3"},{"sentence":"a rather complicated chain of reasoning","translation":"یک زنجیره نسبتاً پیچیده استدلال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687342.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('14dd7ad5-18ac-56a8-9f6a-7a2204c8c92e','7db3024d-088d-5234-9789-35bf0144515c',3,'shops/hotels','مغازه ها/هتل ها','spoken & written','a number of shops , hotels , cinemas etc owned or managed by the same company or person','[ countable ]','chain store','تعدادی مغازه، هتل، سینما و غیره که توسط همان شرکت یا شخص اداره می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/major/large chain It is one of Europe’s biggest clothing chains.','a hotel chain Hilton is an international hotel chain.','a supermarket chain Many people buy all their food at one of the major supermarket chains.','a retail chain (= one whose business is buying and selling goods ) Large retail chains usually want to expand and build more stores.','a department store/video store/food store etc chain Morgan was the owner of a computer store chain.','a restaurant chain the Pizza Hut restaurant chain','a grocery chain These are two of Florida’s largest grocery chains.','a fast-food chain the fast-food chain, Burger King','a national/nationwide chain He was head of a national chain of grocery stores.','be part of a chain The hotel is part of the MacDonald chain.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a chain of restaurants","translation":"رستوران های زنجیره ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068835.mp3"},{"sentence":"several major UK supermarket chains","translation":"چندین سوپرمارکت زنجیره ای بزرگ در بریتانیا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068838.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('9ac9810b-f93f-58c8-a387-abc5fda5f0c6','7db3024d-088d-5234-9789-35bf0144515c',4,'connected line','خط متصل','technical','people or things which are connected or next to each other forming a line','[ countable ]',null,'افراد یا چیزهایی که به هم متصل یا در کنار یکدیگر هستند و یک خط را تشکیل می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the Andean mountain chain","translation":"زنجیره کوه آند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068846.mp3"},{"sentence":"a chain of amino acids","translation":"زنجیره ای از اسیدهای آمینه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687353.mp3"},{"sentence":"They formed a human chain (= a line of people who pass things from one person to the next ) to move the equipment.","translation":"آنها یک زنجیره انسانی (= صفی از افرادی که چیزها را از فردی به فرد دیگر منتقل می کنند) تشکیل دادند تا وسایل را جابجا کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068847.mp3"},{"sentence":"daisy chains (= flowers tied together )","translation":"زنجیر دیزی (= گلهای به هم گره خورده)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687358.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('96f40f95-10b9-5fde-90f3-1c54c6457cfd','7db3024d-088d-5234-9789-35bf0144515c',5,'prisoners','زندانیان','spoken & written','metal chains fastened to the legs and arms of a prisoner , to prevent them from escaping','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'زنجیر فلزی به پاها و بازوهای یک زندانی برای جلوگیری از فرار آنها بسته شده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was led away in chains.","translation":"او را در زنجیر بردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068857.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ba282572-450d-5ab6-8bd8-d7b92c3b9a79','7db3024d-088d-5234-9789-35bf0144515c',6,'buying a house','خرید خانه','spoken & written','a number of people buying houses, where each person must complete the sale of their own house before they can buy the next person’s house','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'تعدادی از افراد در حال خرید خانه هستند، جایی که هر فرد باید قبل از خرید خانه شخص بعدی، فروش خانه خود را تکمیل کند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('38ecdba4-ff26-5e68-80b9-c6f77be3289b','6c93e7b1-261c-5f29-a71d-3e56f436c625',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to fasten someone or something to something else using a chain, especially in order to prevent them from escaping or being stolen','[ transitive ]',null,'بستن کسی یا چیزی به چیز دیگری با استفاده از زنجیر مخصوصاً برای جلوگیری از فرار یا دزدیده شدن آنها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a bicycle chained to the fence","translation":"یک دوچرخه زنجیر شده به نرده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000879354.mp3"},{"sentence":"Four activists chained themselves to the gates.","translation":"چهار فعال خود را به دروازه‌ها زنجیر کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687252.mp3"},{"sentence":"The elephants were chained up by their legs.","translation":"فیل ها از پاهایشان زنجیر شده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000879348.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their hands and feet were chained together.","translation":"دست و پاهایشان به هم زنجیر شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000879351.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('29b025a2-679a-5de6-8d2d-932a07510892','6c93e7b1-261c-5f29-a71d-3e56f436c625',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be chained to something',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ea871f08-889a-5ff1-bb45-f3694b394f13','db6df276-319e-5063-a3e8-e36316fc658f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of furniture for one person to sit on, which has a back, a seat , and four legs','[ countable ]',null,'صندلی، کرسی؛ ریاست (نشست)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['sit in/on a chair She sat in her favourite chair.','pull/draw up a chair (= move a chair nearer someone or something ) Pull up a chair and look at these pictures.','take a chair (= sit down in one in a particular place ) Brian took a chair beside his wife.','lean back in your chair He leant back in his chair and took out his pipe.','sink/slump/flop into a chair (= sit down in one in a tired or unhappy way ) Greg groaned and sank into his chair.','collapse in/into a chair (= sit down suddenly because you are very tired or upset ) Eileen collapsed into a chair and burst out crying.','get up from your chair ( also rise from your chair formal ) He got up from his chair and walked to the window.','jump up from your chair (= get up quickly ) ‘Look at the time!’ she cried, jumping up from her chair.','push back your chair (= in order to get up ) He pushed back his chair and stood up.','lounge in a chair (= sit in one in a very relaxed way ) Everyone was outside, lounging in chairs in the sun.','a comfortable chair ( also a comfy chair informal ) The hotel had a TV room with some nice comfy chairs.','a hard chair (= not comfortable ) I sat on a hard chair in the corridor and waited.','an empty chair (= with no one using it ) She came and sat in an empty chair beside me.','a wooden/plastic/leather etc chair In the kitchen was a table with six wooden chairs around it.','a folding chair (= one which you can fold so it is flat ) People were sitting on blankets or folding chairs, listening to the outdoor concert.','a chair leg/arm/back/seat The chair leg has broken.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a kitchen chair","translation":"یک صندلی آشپزخانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000282.mp3"},{"sentence":"They bought a new table and chairs.","translation":"یک میز و صندلی جدید خریدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040006.mp3"},{"sentence":"One of the chair legs was broken.","translation":"یکی از پایه های صندلی شکسته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040007.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was sitting on a wooden chair.","translation":"روی صندلی چوبی نشسته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040008.mp3"},{"sentence":"He sat back in his chair.","translation":"پشتی روی صندلیش نشست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040009.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
