به کرسی مطرح کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068893.mp3"},{"sentence":"Who will be in the chair at tomorrow’s meeting?","translation":"چه کسی در جلسه فردا ریاست خواهد داشت؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001068896.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was nominated as chair of the board of governors.","translation":"وی به عنوان رئیس شورای حکام معرفی شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687382.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
