('4264dcd2-8301-5062-a4e5-1d889b810848','17bb7adf-ef1c-589f-bf57-4b65ca71d43e',1,'find out','پیدا کردن','spoken & written','to do something in order to find out whether something really is correct , true, or in good condition','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'وارسی کردن، چک کردن؛ بازبینی کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Check the tiles carefully before you buy them.","translation":"قبل از خرید کاشی ها را به دقت بررسی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073728.mp3"},{"sentence":"A first rule in solving any mystery is to check the facts.","translation":"اولین قانون در حل هر معمایی، بررسی حقایق است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653104.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fill in the cash book carefully and always check your calculations.","translation":"دفترچه نقدی را با دقت پر کنید و همیشه محاسبات خود را بررسی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653105.mp3"},{"sentence":"Check that all the doors are locked securely.","translation":"بررسی کنید که تمام درها به طور ایمن قفل شده باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653106.mp3"},{"sentence":"Let me just check whether the potatoes are cooked.","translation":"بگذارید فقط بررسی کنم که آیا سیب زمینی ها پخته شده اند یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073734.mp3"},{"sentence":"They paused to check how the other climbers were getting on.","translation":"آنها مکث کردند تا ببینند دیگر کوهنوردان چگونه سوار می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653107.mp3"},{"sentence":"I checked the typing for errors.","translation":"من تایپ را برای خطا بررسی کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073725.mp3"},{"sentence":"Turn the tap on and check for leaks.","translation":"شیر را باز کنید و نشت را بررسی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653108.mp3"},{"sentence":"You must check the evidence against other sources and decide if it is reliable.","translation":"شما باید شواهد را با منابع دیگر بررسی کنید و تصمیم بگیرید که آیا قابل اعتماد هستند یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073741.mp3"},{"sentence":"Positive test results are double-checked (= looked at twice ) to make absolutely sure.","translation":"نتایج مثبت آزمون دوبار بررسی می شود (= دو بار بررسی می شود) تا کاملاً مطمئن شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653111.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('ff4e8b84-1e9d-5903-9eb5-da5e4c1806f5','17bb7adf-ef1c-589f-bf57-4b65ca71d43e',2,'ask somebody','از کسی بپرس','spoken & written','to ask someone whether something is correct, true, or allowed','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'از کسی بپرسید که آیا چیزی درست، درست یا مجاز است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m not authorized to give you a refund – I’ll have to check first.","translation":"من مجاز به بازپرداخت شما نیستم - ابتدا باید بررسی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073752.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make a phone call to check that you’re writing to the right person.","translation":"یک تماس تلفنی برقرار کنید تا بررسی کنید که به شخص مناسب می نویسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073755.mp3"},{"sentence":"Call the factory to check whether the beds can be delivered today.","translation":"با کارخانه تماس بگیرید تا بررسی کنید که آیا تخت ها می توانند امروز تحویل داده شوند یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073758.mp3"},{"sentence":"Check with your doctor before going on a diet.","translation":"قبل از رژیم گرفتن با پزشک خود مشورت کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073761.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('61566ffa-c4b9-53e1-9c4a-9d5bb94f7189','17bb7adf-ef1c-589f-bf57-4b65ca71d43e',3,'not do something','کاری نکن','spoken & written','to suddenly stop yourself from saying or doing something because you realize it would be better not to','[ transitive ]',null,'به طور ناگهانی خود را از گفتن یا انجام کاری منع کنید زیرا متوجه می شوید که بهتر است این کار را نکنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I had to check the urge to laugh out loud.","translation":"باید میل به بلند خندیدن را بررسی می کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073768.mp3"},{"sentence":"He grinned, and then checked himself, not wanting to upset Jack.","translation":"او پوزخندی زد و بعد خودش را چک کرد، نمی خواست جک را ناراحت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653122.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4928436b-75bf-5527-b946-857e404fb539','17bb7adf-ef1c-589f-bf57-4b65ca71d43e',4,'stop something','متوقف کردن چیزی','spoken & written','to stop something bad from getting worse or continuing to happen','[ transitive ]',null,'برای جلوگیری از بدتر شدن یا ادامه اتفاق بد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police are failing to take adequate measures to check the growth in crime.","translation":"پلیس در انجام اقدامات کافی برای کنترل رشد جرم ناکام است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073778.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('93c1ce5c-71b8-537f-af60-5e5c3e21caf8','17bb7adf-ef1c-589f-bf57-4b65ca71d43e',5,'bags/cases etc','کیف / کیف و غیره','spoken & written','to leave your bags at an official place so they can be put on a plane or a train, or to take someone’s bags in order to do this','[ transitive ]',null,'چمدان های خود را در یک مکان رسمی بگذارید تا آنها را در هواپیما یا قطار قرار دهید، یا برای انجام این کار، کیف های شخصی را بردارید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Any luggage over five kilos must be checked.","translation":"هر چمدان بالای پنج کیلو باید چک شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001073799.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('905af6b5-fe8b-5574-9204-5b34d0de7159','17bb7adf-ef1c-589f-bf57-4b65ca71d43e',6,'make a mark','علامت بزن','spoken & written','to make a mark (✓) next to an answer, something on a list etc to show you have chosen it, that it is correct, or that you have dealt with it','[ transitive ]',null,'علامت زدن (✓) در کنار یک پاسخ، چیزی در لیست و غیره برای نشان دادن اینکه آن را انتخاب کرده اید، درست است یا با آن برخورد کرده اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('11f7a7f8-0ec3-5871-9658-a7498345c612','17bb7adf-ef1c-589f-bf57-4b65ca71d43e',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'Check','وارسی کردن، چک کردن؛ بازبینی کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('338a41f3-bdb7-56b2-a28a-40c160375511','3d199ddc-b8fa-5cca-93a3-df68eeca1754',1,null,null,'spoken','say this when someone mentions each thing on a list, to tell them that you have it or have done it',null,null,'وارسی، بازبینی؛ چک (بانکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Passport?’ ‘Check.’ ‘Ticket?’ ‘Check’.","translation":"«گذرنامه؟» «بررسی.» «بلیت؟» «بررسی».","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653140.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4a8230f4-b35e-5800-b653-0e09c147b419','f1802ca6-9e36-5827-bd3d-385de57cd02d',1,'finding out','پیدا کردن','spoken & written','the process of finding out if something is safe, correct, true, or in the condition it should be','[ countable ]',null,'فرآیند کشف اینکه آیا چیزی امن، صحیح، درست است یا در شرایطی که باید باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do a check I did a quick check of all the windows, locked the door and left.','make a check (= do a check ) One of the nurses makes regular checks during the night.','run a check (= especially on something that is strange or suspicious ) You should run a virus check before downloading from the Internet.','carry out/conduct a check formal (= do or run a check ) The police carried out a check on the car’s registration number.','have a check British English Always have a final check to make sure you’ve got your ticket and passport.','give something a check I’d like you to give the car a careful check.','keep a check on somebody/something (= check something regularly ) Keep a check on your baby’s temperature.','go for a medical/dental etc check She advised me to go for a medical check.','a quick check A quick check showed that someone had been in the room.','a thorough/careful check An engineer gave the computer a thorough check.','a routine check (= happening as a normal part of a process ) I went to the doctor for a routine health check.','a random check (= done without any definite pattern ) Customs officials were carrying out random checks on cars.','a regular check It’s vital to keep a regular check on your bank balance.','a close check (= a careful one ) His teacher was keeping a close check on his progress.','a safety/security check The security checks at the airport can take a long time.','a health/medical check People over 60 should have regular medical checks.','a background check (= to get information about someone’s previous work, education, family etc ) The company conducts background checks on security employees.','a credit check (= to get information about someone’s financial history ) Banks usually do a credit check before they give you a loan.','a spot check (= a quick check of one thing in a group done to obtain information ) They did a spot check on 160 vehicles to see how many passengers were wearing seat belts.','a spell check (= a process in which a computer program tells you if you have spelt words wrong ) Have you done a spell check on your essay?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the need for tighter checks on arms sales","translation":"نیاز به کنترل های سخت گیرانه تر بر فروش تسلیحات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653182.mp3"},{"sentence":"Conduct regular checks on your water quality.","translation":"به طور منظم کیفیت آب خود را بررسی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653183.mp3"},{"sentence":"I decided to run a check on all personnel.","translation":"تصمیم گرفتم همه پرسنل را بررسی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653189.mp3"},{"sentence":"I keep a careful check on my blood pressure.","translation":"فشار خونم را به دقت چک می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653190.mp3"},{"sentence":"Have a check in your bag first and see if it’s there.","translation":"ابتدا کیف خود را چک کنید و ببینید که آیا آنجا هست یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001074630.mp3"},{"sentence":"the airport’s routine security checks","translation":"بررسی های امنیتی معمول فرودگاه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001074624.mp3"},{"sentence":"random drug checks","translation":"بررسی تصادفی دارو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653200.mp3"},{"sentence":"a spot check on the accounts","translation":"بررسی لحظه ای حساب ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653205.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
