('76c0e4a8-8388-5ec3-9b6d-b2495a343834','8079447f-0f7d-5569-948d-872057e7277c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to speak rudely or with disrespect to someone, especially to someone older such as your teacher or parents',null,null,'صحبت کردن با بی ادبی یا بی احترامی با کسی، به خصوص با بزرگتر از جمله معلم یا والدین','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You can cheek some teachers and they just don’t do anything.","translation":"شما می توانید برخی از معلمان را نادیده بگیرید و آنها کاری انجام نمی دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001074944.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('af66772f-1a3f-5e6f-8062-97fd027dd07b','c20a2226-8d7a-5c0a-a68f-ddd87dd1e852',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the front part of your body between your neck and your stomach',null,'flat-chested','سینه؛ صندوقچه؛ بخش سینه‌ای','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['broad a tall man with a broad chest and shoulders','powerful His arms were folded across his powerful chest.','muscular (= with big muscles ) His chest was tanned and muscular.','hairy His shirt was unbuttoned, revealing a hairy chest.','bare (= not covered by clothes ) The workmen all had bare chests.','bad (= one that is making you cough or giving you pain ) I''m not going running today - my chest is bad.','weak (= one that often gets infections ) As a child her chest was weak.','a chest pain There are a number of causes of chest pain.','a chest infection Every time I get a cold I get a chest infection too.','a chest complaint/problem (= something wrong with your chest and causing you pain ) Older people often suffer from chest complaints.','a chest injury/wound He suffered serious chest injuries in the accident.','a chest X-ray (= a photograph of the inside of your chest, to see if it is healthy ) A chest X-ray showed that there was damage to his lungs.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her heart was pounding in her chest.","translation":"قلبش در سینه اش می تپید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675613.mp3"},{"sentence":"a hairy chest","translation":"یک سینه مودار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000505837.mp3"},{"sentence":"He collapsed with severe chest pains.","translation":"او با درد شدید قفسه سینه به زمین افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675617.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
