’s an expert in child development.','child labour British English , child labor American English (= the use of children as workers ) The garments were made using child labour.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The hotel is ideal for families with young children.","translation":"این هتل برای خانواده هایی با فرزندان خردسال ایده آل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675966.mp3"},{"sentence":"The film is not suitable for children under 12.","translation":"این فیلم برای کودکان زیر 12 سال مناسب نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675968.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was very happy as a child (= when I was a child ) .","translation":"من در کودکی بسیار خوشحال بودم (= وقتی بچه بودم ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675969.mp3"},{"sentence":"For a child of five this was a terrifying experience.","translation":"برای یک کودک پنج ساله این یک تجربه وحشتناک بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675976.mp3"},{"sentence":"a famous writer of children’s books","translation":"نویسنده معروف کتاب کودک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000296.mp3"},{"sentence":"child victims of war","translation":"کودکان قربانی جنگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000297.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
