('91afb91a-a2fc-5e1d-99dc-417140dbf7a4','053fef9f-d3ea-5928-b557-0086bd904919',1,'easy to understand','آسان برای درک','spoken & written','expressed in a simple and direct way so that people understand',null,null,'روشن، واضح؛ ساده و روان؛ بی‌دخل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make something clear Children may have difficulty in making their feelings clear.','get something clear (= understand something properly ) I was trying to get the idea clear in my mind.','absolutely/perfectly clear His answer was perfectly clear.','crystal clear (= extremely clear ) The instructions on the packet are crystal clear.','abundantly clear formal (= extremely clear ) By July the scale of the problem had become abundantly clear.','not entirely clear Sam’s reasons for leaving were not entirely clear.','a clear picture/idea (= a good understanding ) Some work experience should give you a clear idea of what the job involves.','make it clear that The tone of her voice made it clear that she was very angry.','make yourself clear (= express yourself in a way that is easy to understand ) Please tell me if I’m not making myself clear.','be far from clear/be by no means clear (= be very unclear ) The directions she gave me were far from clear.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"clear instructions","translation":"دستورالعمل های روشن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080284.mp3"},{"sentence":"The question wasn’t very clear.","translation":"سوال خیلی واضح نبود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080285.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s the clearest guide I’ve used.","translation":"این واضح ترین راهنمای من است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001670478.mp3"},{"sentence":"The school is clear about its policy on bullying.","translation":"مدرسه در مورد سیاست خود در مورد قلدری روشن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001670481.mp3"},{"sentence":"Be very clear about what jobs should be completed, and by when.","translation":"در مورد کارهایی که باید تکمیل شوند و تا چه زمانی باید کاملاً روشن باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001670484.mp3"},{"sentence":"The rules are quite clear on the point.","translation":"قوانین در این مورد کاملاً واضح است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080288.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was clear to him that Tolkien was a literary genius.","translation":"برای او واضح بود که تالکین یک نابغه ادبی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080291.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bishop made his views clear in a letter to the publisher.","translation":"اسقف نظرات خود را در نامه ای به ناشر به وضوح بیان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080295.mp3"},{"sentence":"How can you make the meaning clearer?","translation":"چگونه می توانید معنی را واضح تر بیان کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001670494.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make it clear that you will not take sides.","translation":"روشن کنید که طرفداری نخواهید کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080298.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can I make it absolutely clear that we did not intend this to happen?","translation":"آیا می توانم کاملاً روشن کنم که ما قصد نداشتیم این اتفاق بیفتد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001670506.mp3"},{"sentence":"Perhaps I tried to cover too much and didn’t make myself clear (= express myself well ) .","translation":"شايد سعي كردم زيادي را پوشش دهم و خود را روشن نكردم (= خوب بيان كنم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080302.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you don’t understand, it’s best to say so and get things clear .","translation":"اگر متوجه نمی شوید، بهتر است این را بگویید و همه چیز را روشن کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080305.mp3"},{"sentence":"If I catch you smoking again, you’re grounded. Do I make myself clear? (= used when you are angry )","translation":"اگر دوباره تو را در حال سیگار کشیدن بگیرم، زمین گیر شده ای. آیا خودم را روشن کنم؟ (= وقتی عصبانی هستید استفاده می شود)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080309.mp3"},{"sentence":"The report gave a clear picture of the property’s condition.","translation":"این گزارش تصویر واضحی از وضعیت ملک ارائه می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001670520.mp3"},{"sentence":"He writes crystal clear (= very easy to understand ) prose.","translation":"او نثر شفاف (= بسیار آسان برای درک) می نویسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001670521.mp3"}]'::jsonb,16),
('714eb7d2-846e-5304-aa8c-fad922ee61df','053fef9f-d3ea-5928-b557-0086bd904919',2,'impossible to doubt','غیر ممکن برای شک','spoken & written','impossible to doubt, question, or make a mistake about',null,null,'شک کردن، سوال کردن یا اشتباه کردن در مورد آن غیرممکن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make something clear Children may have difficulty in making their feelings clear.','get something clear (= understand something properly ) I was trying to get the idea clear in my mind.','absolutely/perfectly clear His answer was perfectly clear.','crystal clear (= extremely clear ) The instructions on the packet are crystal clear.','abundantly clear formal (= extremely clear ) By July the scale of the problem had become abundantly clear.','not entirely clear Sam’s reasons for leaving were not entirely clear.','a clear picture/idea (= a good understanding ) Some work experience should give you a clear idea of what the job involves.','make it clear that The tone of her voice made it clear that she was very angry.','make yourself clear (= express yourself in a way that is easy to understand ) Please tell me if I’m not making myself clear.','be far from clear/be by no means clear (= be very unclear ) The directions she gave me were far from clear.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"clear evidence of guilt","translation":"شواهد روشن از گناه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080321.mp3"},{"sentence":"They won by a clear majority.","translation":"آنها با اکثریت قاطع پیروز شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080322.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s not clear whether he shares her views.","translation":"مشخص نیست که آیا او نظرات او را به اشتراک می گذارد یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080325.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s clear that the drug does benefit some patients.","translation":"واضح است که این دارو برای برخی از بیماران مفید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080328.mp3"},{"sentence":"When it became clear that I was pregnant, he left me.","translation":"وقتی معلوم شد حامله ام، مرا ترک کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080331.mp3"},{"sentence":"a clear case of sexual discrimination","translation":"یک مورد آشکار از تبعیض جنسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001080334.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
