('8ad49a4c-8066-51c7-8ac0-f9995d1339ff','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',1,'near','نزدیک','spoken & written','not far from someone or something',null,null,'نزدیک، مجاور؛ صمیمی؛ مسابقه نزدیک',array['near']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"If you need to buy bread or milk, the closest shop is about a mile away.","translation":"اگر نیاز به خرید نان یا شیر دارید، نزدیکترین مغازه حدود یک مایل دورتر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085286.mp3"},{"sentence":"Susan sat on a chair close to the window.","translation":"سوزان روی صندلی نزدیک پنجره نشست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782497.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t mind where we go on vacation as long as it’s close to a beach.","translation":"تا زمانی که نزدیک ساحل باشد، برایم مهم نیست که تعطیلات به کجا می رویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782498.mp3"},{"sentence":"His eyes were small and close together .","translation":"چشمانش کوچک و نزدیک به هم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782499.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are several accounts of dolphins living in close proximity to humans (= close to humans ) .","translation":"چندین روایت از زندگی دلفین ها در نزدیکی انسان (= نزدیک به انسان) وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085292.mp3"},{"sentence":"The victim had been shot at close range (= from very close ) .","translation":"قربانی از فاصله نزدیک (= از خیلی نزدیک) مورد اصابت گلوله قرار گرفته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085297.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('fde1207a-8f7f-503a-a33e-f555c2f2d8d2','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',2,'near in time','نزدیک در زمان','spoken & written','near to something in time',null,null,'نزدیک به چیزی در زمان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was close to 1:15 a.m.","translation":"ساعت نزدیک 1:15 بامداد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000328.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our birthdays are quite close together.","translation":"تولدهای ما کاملاً به هم نزدیک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782516.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a1b78020-6650-5365-a3b6-54655fa2e00b','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',3,'likely to happen','به احتمال زیاد اتفاق می افتد','spoken & written','seeming very likely to happen or very likely to do something soon',null,null,'به نظر می رسد بسیار محتمل است که اتفاق بیفتد یا به احتمال زیاد کاری به زودی انجام شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The two countries are close to signing a peace agreement.","translation":"دو کشور به امضای توافقنامه صلح نزدیک شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085316.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re close to clinching the deal.","translation":"ما به توافق نزدیک شده ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782518.mp3"},{"sentence":"The old dog could barely whimper and seemed close to death.","translation":"سگ پیر به سختی می توانست ناله کند و نزدیک به مرگ به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782521.mp3"},{"sentence":"The prosecution’s main witness was close to tears as she described the assault.","translation":"شاهد اصلی دادستان هنگام تشریح این حمله نزدیک به گریه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782522.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('b7a591d9-0af4-596b-8306-270557f7e8b6','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',4,'like/love','دوست داشتن/دوست داشتن','spoken & written','if two people are close, they like or love each other very much',null,null,'اگر دو نفر صمیمی باشند، همدیگر را خیلی دوست دارند یا دوست دارند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"My brother and I are very close.","translation":"من و برادرم خیلی صمیمی هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085371.mp3"},{"sentence":"I felt closer to Rob that evening than ever before.","translation":"آن شب بیشتر از همیشه به راب نزدیکتر بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085374.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fiona and I have always been close friends .","translation":"من و فیونا همیشه دوستان صمیمی بوده ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085377.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('cc9c4639-b3dc-5cd2-b304-c4af234a069f','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',5,'similar','مشابه','spoken & written','very similar to each other',null,null,'بسیار شبیه به یکدیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"When I saw Henry with another woman I felt something close to jealousy.","translation":"وقتی هنری را با زن دیگری دیدم چیزی نزدیک به حسادت احساس کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782528.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fitt was the closest thing to a socialist in the party.","translation":"فیت نزدیکترین چیز به یک سوسیالیست در حزب بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782529.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their newest model bears a close resemblance to (= is very similar to ) that of their rival competitor.","translation":"جدیدترین مدل آنها شباهت زیادی به (= بسیار شبیه به) مدل رقیبشان دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782533.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5225e9ce-78f6-5482-997b-fdd8dcb8e716','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',6,'careful','مراقب باشید','spoken & written','looking at, thinking about, or watching something very carefully','[ usually before noun ]',null,'به چیزی با دقت نگاه کردن، فکر کردن یا تماشا کردن آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['take/get a close look She moved forward to take a close look at the painting.','keep a close eye/watch on somebody/something (= watch someone or something carefully ) They have to keep a close eye on their finances.','a close examination A closer examination of the facts soon solved the mystery.','a close study Their research involved a close study of two communities.','close attention You will lose weight if you combine exercise with close attention to your diet.','close scrutiny (= careful and thorough examination of someone or something ) The investigation included close scrutiny of the images on CCTV.','close inspection (= looking at someone or something in detail ) Closer inspection revealed that the rocks were from an earlier period.','close supervision (= constantly making sure that someone does things in the correct way ) Initially there will be close supervision of the trainee.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She lifted up Jenny’s silver medallion to take a closer look.","translation":"او مدال نقره جنی را بلند کرد تا از نزدیک نگاه کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085322.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t worry, I’ll keep a close eye on the kids.","translation":"نگران نباش، من به دقت مراقب بچه ها هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085326.mp3"},{"sentence":"You could have improved your answers by closer attention to detail.","translation":"شما می توانستید با توجه بیشتر به جزئیات پاسخ های خود را بهبود بخشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782541.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a398924d-c40a-5ac3-a342-be532043b4c8','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',7,'number/amount','تعداد/مقدار','spoken & written','if a number or amount is close to another number or amount, it is not much higher or lower than it',null,null,'اگر عدد یا مقداری به عدد یا مقدار دیگری نزدیک باشد، خیلی بیشتر یا کمتر از آن نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We don’t know the exact figures, but about 10,000 might be a close approximation (= close to the actual figure ) .","translation":"ما ارقام دقیق را نمی دانیم، اما حدود 10000 ممکن است تقریبی نزدیک باشد (= نزدیک به رقم واقعی).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782546.mp3"},{"sentence":"Inflation is close to 7 percent.","translation":"تورم نزدیک به 7 درصد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085341.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('066d3f95-4344-5490-b2d1-625927de7ff0','20a4bb74-2215-581a-ac75-fb65b1dfff83',8,'competition/election etc','رقابت/انتخابات و غیره','spoken & written','finishing or being played, fought etc with both sides almost equal',null,null,'تمام کردن یا بازی کردن، جنگیدن و غیره با هر دو طرف تقریبا برابر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was a close game that could have gone either way.","translation":"این یک بازی نزدیک بود که می توانست به هر دو صورت پیش برود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782551.mp3"},{"sentence":"The result is too close to call (= so close that it is impossible to know who will win ) .","translation":"نتیجه برای فراخوانی خیلی نزدیک است (= آنقدر نزدیک که نمی توان فهمید چه کسی برنده خواهد شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001782552.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
