s hung low in the sky.','cloud cover The cloud cover should disappear by the afternoon.','cloud formation (= the shape in which cloud forms ) There are many different types of cloud formation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"A cloud of steam rose into the air.","translation":"ابری از بخار به هوا بلند شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687101.mp3"},{"sentence":"clouds of mosquitoes buzzing around us","translation":"ابرهای پشه در اطراف ما وزوز می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687102.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
