hould disappear by the afternoon.','cloud formation (= the shape in which cloud forms ) There are many different types of cloud formation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the cloud of economic recession","translation":"ابر رکود اقتصادی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085776.mp3"},{"sentence":"The only cloud on the horizon was her mother’s illness.","translation":"تنها ابر در افق بیماری مادرش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085780.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fears of renewed terrorist attacks cast a cloud over the event (= spoilt the happy situation ) .","translation":"ترس از حملات تروریستی مجدد ابری بر این رویداد افکنده است (= وضعیت شاد را خراب کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001085784.mp3"},{"sentence":"He returned to New York under a cloud of gloom and despair.","translation":"او در زیر ابری از تاریکی و ناامیدی به نیویورک بازگشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687104.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
