 was a taste in court circles for romantic verse.","translation":"در محافل دربار ذوق شعر عاشقانه وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001681012.mp3"},{"sentence":"Court officials denied the rumours.","translation":"مقامات دادگاه این شایعات را تکذیب کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989889.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
