('6e74978a-5ad9-52fa-90c4-669554002b58','baf3873e-62bf-55ac-bf52-4548355f95bc',7,'plants','گیاهان','spoken & written','trees and plants that grow in large numbers on a piece of land','[ uncountable ]',null,'درختان و گیاهانی که به تعداد زیاد در یک قطعه زمین رشد می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the front/back cover The price of the book is on the back cover.','a hard/soft cover I never buy books in hard cover – they’re much more expensive.','a book/magazine cover There was a blonde girl on the magazine cover.','a cover story (= the main story on the front of a newspaper or magazine ) Last month’s cover story was entitled ‘Your Child’s Brain’.','a cover photo/shot (= picture on the front cover ) The picture became the July 4th cover shot.','a cover design the cover design of the Christmas issue','a cover girl (= an attractive girl whose photo is on the front cover ) She had always liked the idea of being a cover girl.','read something from cover to cover (= read a book, magazine etc very thoroughly ) He read it from cover to cover in less than three hours.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Once the forest cover is felled, rains wash away the soil.","translation":"هنگامی که پوشش جنگل قطع شد، باران خاک را می شست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001681211.mp3"},{"sentence":"With its spreading stems, ivy makes good ground cover .","translation":"پیچک با ساقه های در حال گسترش خود پوشش خوبی برای زمین ایجاد می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001681212.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
