('fa0d1d72-705d-5fe7-8690-19017fcfd62a','baf3873e-62bf-55ac-bf52-4548355f95bc',11,'secret','راز','spoken & written','behaviour or activities that seem normal or honest but are being used to hide something bad or illegal','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'رفتار یا فعالیت هایی که طبیعی یا صادقانه به نظر می رسند اما برای پنهان کردن چیز بد یا غیرقانونی استفاده می شوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the front/back cover The price of the book is on the back cover.','a hard/soft cover I never buy books in hard cover – they’re much more expensive.','a book/magazine cover There was a blonde girl on the magazine cover.','a cover story (= the main story on the front of a newspaper or magazine ) Last month’s cover story was entitled ‘Your Child’s Brain’.','a cover photo/shot (= picture on the front cover ) The picture became the July 4th cover shot.','a cover design the cover design of the Christmas issue','a cover girl (= an attractive girl whose photo is on the front cover ) She had always liked the idea of being a cover girl.','read something from cover to cover (= read a book, magazine etc very thoroughly ) He read it from cover to cover in less than three hours.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The gang used the shop as a cover for drug deals.","translation":"این باند از مغازه به عنوان پوششی برای معاملات مواد مخدر استفاده می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001116140.mp3"},{"sentence":"All that toughness is just a cover for his inability to show affection.","translation":"تمام آن سرسختی فقط پوششی است برای ناتوانی او در نشان دادن محبت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001681246.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
