('d5688f66-f558-5311-8089-5f4cbe1e0bb2','ac3ad2ce-f7d8-5264-ab03-c3855582879e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a special set of movements performed to a particular type of music','[ countable ]',null,'رقص، پایکوبی؛ نوع رقص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a traditional dance The drum is often used in Africa to accompany traditional dances.','a folk dance (= typical of the ordinary people who live somewhere ) This is one of the oldest folk dances in Greece.','a national dance The Tango is Argentina’s national dance.','do a dance Can you do any dances?','perform a dance We watched the group perform some traditional Spanish dances.','a dance routine/sequence (= a set of movements that are part of a dance ) She was practising a complicated dance routine.','a dance step (= a movement in a dance ) Lou was teaching me a few dance steps.','dance music A small band was playing dance music.','a dance floor (= special floor for people to dance on )','a dance band (= playing music that people can dance to ) a professional dance band']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The waltz is an easy dance to learn.","translation":"والس یک رقص آسان برای یادگیری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000831958.mp3"},{"sentence":"the traditional dances and music of Russia","translation":"رقص ها و موسیقی سنتی روسیه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798854.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
