('772319f6-b038-5eea-b38d-5fce8c60d52a','5d01aaba-bfa7-5d35-860c-fc3837e5818c',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'open to doubt','تردید، شک؛ دودلی؛ شبهه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have doubts Scientists still have some doubts about the theory.','have your doubts (= have some doubts ) Everyone else thinks it’s a good idea, but I have my doubts.','have no/little doubt I have no doubt that you are right.','be in no/any doubt about something The government is in no doubt about the seriousness of the situation.','leave no/little doubt (that) (= make people sure or almost sure about something ) The evidence left no doubt that he was the murderer.','cast/throw doubt on something (= make people unsure about something ) Research has cast doubt on the safety of mobile phones.','raise doubts about something (= make people unsure about something ) His handling of the matter has raised doubts about his competence.','call/throw something into doubt (= make people unsure about something ) The accuracy of his account was called into doubt.','express/voice doubts (= say that you have doubts ) Many people expressed doubts about the necessity of the war.','serious/grave doubts They have some serious doubts as to his honesty.','considerable doubts I had considerable doubts about accepting the job.','a lingering/nagging doubt (= one that does not go away ) I still had a nagging doubt that there might be something seriously wrong.','there is no/little/some doubt (= used to talk about how sure people are about something ) There is little doubt that he will play for England one day.','without a shadow of a doubt (= without any doubt ) I knew without a shadow of a doubt that I was going to win.','an element of doubt (= a slight doubt ) There’s an element of doubt about his true age as he doesn’t have a birth certificate.','not the slightest doubt (= no doubt ) There’s not the slightest doubt in my mind about it.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('095c4962-270b-5acd-a955-d9d3d4f11a64','d041b4b2-5a95-52e1-b95b-017d255bef10',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that something may not be true or that it is unlikely',null,null,'تردید داشتن، مشکوک بودن؛ باور نداشتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Kim never doubted his story.","translation":"کیم هرگز در داستان خود شک نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001152128.mp3"},{"sentence":"I doubt we’ll ever see him again.","translation":"من شک دارم که او را دوباره ببینیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777084.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can complain, but I doubt if it’ll make any difference.","translation":"شما می توانید شکایت کنید، اما من شک دارم که تفاوتی ایجاد کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001152139.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Do you think there’ll be any tickets left?’ ‘ I doubt it (= I don’t think so ) .’","translation":"«فکر می‌کنی بلیت‌هایی باقی بماند؟» «شک دارم (= فکر نمی‌کنم اینطور باشد)».","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777087.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('45579a59-4d47-515e-a4db-ed30a36f468d','d041b4b2-5a95-52e1-b95b-017d255bef10',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to not trust or have confidence in someone',null,null,'اعتماد نکردن یا اعتماد نکردن به کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I never doubted myself. I always knew I could play tennis at this level.","translation":"هیچ وقت به خودم شک نکردم همیشه می دانستم که می توانم در این سطح تنیس بازی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777092.mp3"},{"sentence":"She loved him, and had never doubted him.","translation":"او را دوست داشت و هرگز به او شک نکرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777093.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have no reason to doubt his word (= think that he is lying ) .","translation":"من دلیلی ندارم که به حرف او شک کنم (= فکر کن دروغ می گوید ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777094.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b2589130-8a07-518b-a70e-a9893d68586f','b8bee721-fe41-598a-bf30-db8832de5a1f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','twelve',null,null,'دوجین، دوازده (۱۲)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a dozen eggs","translation":"یک دوجین تخم مرغ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001809939.mp3"},{"sentence":"The number of deaths has risen to more than two dozen.","translation":"تعداد کشته شدگان به بیش از دو ده افزایش یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001809945.mp3"},{"sentence":"Dozens of people were killed.","translation":"ده ها نفر کشته شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001809951.mp3"},{"sentence":"Chris, Helen, and half a dozen others went on holiday together.","translation":"کریس، هلن و نیم دوجین نفر دیگر با هم به تعطیلات رفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777110.mp3"},{"sentence":"A dozen or so (= about 12 ) cars were parked near the entrance.","translation":"حدود 12 اتومبیل (= حدود 12) در نزدیکی ورودی پارک شده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777114.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('f83511b9-fd49-59df-9283-f015dc6b5a9f','b8bee721-fe41-598a-bf30-db8832de5a1f',2,null,null,'informal','a lot of',null,null,'بسیاری از','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve heard this story a dozen times before.","translation":"این داستان را قبلاً ده ها بار شنیده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001809955.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s had dozens of boyfriends.","translation":"او ده ها دوست پسر داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001809958.mp3"},{"sentence":"We collected dozens and dozens of shells on the beach.","translation":"ده ها و ده ها صدف در ساحل جمع آوری کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777117.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ff7f765f-17e4-537b-8337-90109dddacbc','2651545e-758e-54de-ac89-69a80cf11ad1',1,'piece of writing','قطعه نوشته','spoken & written','a piece of writing or a plan that is not yet in its finished form',null,null,'پیش‌نویس، طرح اولیه؛ پیش‌نویس کردن (قانون)؛ چرخش هوا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the first/second etc draft The second draft of the agreement contained a few important changes.','the final draft (= the finished form ) He showed me the final draft of his letter.','a rough draft (= not the finished form ) Could you let me see a rough draft of your report?','the original draft (= the first one ) The hero had a different name in the original draft of the story.','an early/earlier draft (= written before others ) In earlier drafts of the speech, he criticized the pace of political progress.','a preliminary draft (= coming before others ) A preliminary draft of the charter has been issued.','write/draw up/prepare a draft (= write one ) Always write a rough draft of your essay first. He drew up a draft of the club’s rules and regulations.','approve a draft (= officially accept one ) The draft was approved by the Senate.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the rough draft of his new novel","translation":"پیش نویس خشن رمان جدیدش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777124.mp3"},{"sentence":"I read the first draft and thought it was very good.","translation":"من پیش نویس اول را خواندم و به نظرم خیلی خوب بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777128.mp3"},{"sentence":"All parties eventually approved the final draft (= finished form ) of the peace treaty.","translation":"همه طرف ها در نهایت پیش نویس نهایی (= شکل تمام شده) پیمان صلح را تایید کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777132.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
