1758279.mp3"},{"sentence":"a night of high drama (= very exciting events )","translation":"یک شب پر درام (= رویدادهای بسیار هیجان انگیز)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001758280.mp3"},{"sentence":"the drama of the moment","translation":"درام لحظه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001758284.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
