('d5aac17d-799d-563e-ad3c-7623a7a766c6','6497766d-6597-533e-b600-d89bf17e5f50',1,'first part','قسمت اول','spoken & written','in the first part of a period of time, event, or process',null,null,'اوایل (دوره)؛ زودهنگام؛ اولین (ساعت‌ها)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['early morning/afternoon/evening The lake looked beautiful in the pale early morning light.','early spring/summer etc These plants produce flowers from early spring to late summer.','early August/January etc Italy is lovely in early June, before it gets too hot.','the early days/months/years of something (= the period of time near the beginning of something ) In the early years of our marriage, we lived with my wife’s parents.','in your early twenties/forties etc (= aged 20–23,40–43 etc ) Both men are in their early twenties.','the early 1920s/1970s etc (= 1920–23,1970–73 etc ) He lived in London in the early 1980s.','somebody’s early childhood/adolescence/life (= when someone is a young child, adolescent etc ) We’ve known each other since early childhood.','an early stage (= near the beginning of a process ) Patients can be treated with drugs, especially at the early stage of the disease.','the early part of something (= near the beginning of an event or period of time ) I was doing quite well in the early part of the race.','somebody’s earliest memory (= the first thing you can remember about something from your past ) One of my earliest memories is of being at a busy railway station, trying to find my mum.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the early morning sunshine","translation":"آفتاب صبح زود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001623030.mp3"},{"sentence":"an afternoon in early spring","translation":"یک بعد از ظهر در اوایل بهار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001623029.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the early days , the railways mainly carried goods.","translation":"در روزهای اولیه، راه آهن عمدتاً کالا را حمل می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001623031.mp3"},{"sentence":"She is in her early twenties .","translation":"او در اوایل بیست سالگی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001623042.mp3"},{"sentence":"the recession of the early 1980s","translation":"رکود اقتصادی اوایل دهه 1980","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001623035.mp3"},{"sentence":"The money could be paid as early as next week.","translation":"این پول می تواند در اوایل هفته آینده پرداخت شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971028.mp3"},{"sentence":"He spent the early part of his career at St John’s Hospital.","translation":"او قسمت های اولیه زندگی خود را در بیمارستان سنت جان گذراند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001623038.mp3"},{"sentence":"the experiences of early childhood","translation":"تجربیات دوران کودکی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971035.mp3"},{"sentence":"the early works of Shakespeare","translation":"آثار اولیه شکسپیر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971038.mp3"},{"sentence":"My earliest memories are of fruit trees.","translation":"اولین خاطرات من مربوط به درختان میوه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971042.mp3"},{"sentence":"Early signs are encouraging.","translation":"علائم اولیه دلگرم کننده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971046.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
